{
  "tema": 6979,
  "slug": "lo-adjetivo",
  "titulo": "The neuter article lo + adjective (+ ser)",
  "subtitulo": "Lo bueno es que hay olas: the good thing, the hard part.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Lo + masculine singular adjective = the … thing / what is …: lo bueno, lo difícil. Lo + adjective + de highlights a quality. Lo + adjective + ser: lo malo es que…",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Spanish has a **neuter article**, **lo**, that goes with **adjectives** (not nouns). **Lo** + adjective means _the … thing_ or _what is …_: **lo verde** = _what's green_, **lo pesado** = _the heavy stuff_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The adjective is always **masculine singular** here."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**lo**",
            "adjective"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Lo** + adjective + **de** highlights a quality of something: **lo salado del jamón** = _how salty the ham is_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Very common with **ser**: **lo bueno es que…**, **lo malo es que…**, **lo difícil es…**, **lo importante es…**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**lo**",
            "adjective",
            "**ser**",
            "the rest"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **lo** turns an adjective into an idea."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Me encanta todo ==lo verde==.",
              "en": "I love everything green."
            },
            {
              "es": "Yo llevo ==lo pesado== y tú llevas ==lo ligero==.",
              "en": "I'll carry the heavy stuff and you carry the light stuff."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tengo ==lo justo== para vivir.",
              "en": "I have just enough to live on."
            },
            {
              "es": "No soporto ==lo salado== del jamón.",
              "en": "I can't stand how salty the ham is."
            },
            {
              "es": "Me encantó ==lo romántico== de esa película.",
              "en": "I loved how romantic that movie was."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Lo malo es== que no puedo ir contigo al cine.",
              "en": "The bad thing is that I can't go to the movies with you."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Lo bueno es== que mañana no llueve.",
              "en": "The good thing is that it's not raining tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Lo difícil es== levantarse a las cinco.",
              "en": "The hard part is getting up at five."
            }
          ]
        }
